=== scene sj_hi2
sujin[happy]: 아, {학생}! {안녕하세요}.
(She was already looking your way before you said anything.)

=== scene sj_weather
sujin: {오늘} {날씨}{가|이/가} {좋아요}.
(She tilts her face up toward the sky.)
* {네}, {좋아요}! -> sj_weather_a
* {아니요}... -> sj_weather_b

=== scene sj_weather_a
sujin[happy]: {네}! {같이} {산}{에} {가요}?
(She laughs before you can answer. One day, maybe.)
! rel sujin +1

=== scene sj_weather_b
sujin[surprised]: {아니요}? 하하.
(She looks at the sky, then at you, then at the sky again.)

