=== scene sj_workshop
sujin: {여기}{는|은/는} {엄마}{의} {공방}{이에요}.
(She runs a finger along the edge of the workbench.)
sujin: {저}{는|은/는} {탈}{을|을/를} {안} {만들어요}.
